a:T4ab,Al Sadiq Health Care Centre (ASHCC) has been serving the Lahore community with dedication to compassionate, affordable, and high-quality healthcare. What began as a commitment to making quality medical care accessible to everyone has grown into a trusted centre offering a wide range of services — from routine checkups and preventive screenings to specialist consultations in cardiology, pediatrics, gynecology, dermatology, and general medicine.

Our team of experienced doctors, nurses, and support staff work together with one shared goal: to ensure every patient who walks through our doors receives the attention, respect, and care they deserve. We understand that visiting a healthcare centre can be stressful, which is why we've built our practice around patience, clear communication, and genuine concern for our patients' wellbeing — not just their symptoms.

At ASHCC, we hold ourselves to the highest standards of clinical excellence while never losing sight of the human side of medicine. Whether you're here for a routine visit or a more complex health concern, our team is committed to walking alongside you at every step, with honesty, empathy, and expertise you can rely on.5:["$","section",null,{"className":"section bg-ink-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container-app grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"section-eyebrow","children":"About ASHCC"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"section-title","children":"Dedicated to the Health of Our Community"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-ink-600","children":"$a"}],["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/about","className":"btn-outline mt-6","children":["More About Us ",["$","svg",null,{"stroke":"currentColor","fill":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"0","viewBox":"0 0 20 20","aria-hidden":"true","children":["$undefined",[["$","path","0",{"fillRule":"evenodd","d":"M10.293 3.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 010 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L14.586 11H3a1 1 0 110-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z","clipRule":"evenodd","children":[]}]]],"style":{},"height":"1em","width":"1em","xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-2 gap-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"card flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 p-8 text-center","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-4xl font-bold text-brand-500","children":"10+"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-ink-600","children":"Years of Service"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"card flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-2 p-8 text-center","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-4xl font-bold text-brand-500","children":"1000+"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm font-semibold text-ink-600","children":"Happy Patients"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"card flex flex